TI  - SPARQL-Planned Single-Hop Traversal over a Live Knowledge Graph for Multi-Hop Question Answering
AU  - Vakharia, Priyesh
AU  - Moshtaghi, Masud
AU  - Banerjee, Pratyay
AU  - Jedema, Nicholas
AU  - Misra, Amita
AU  - Chadha, Ankit
